{"Title":"An Act relative to spare tires","BillNumber":"H3345","DocketNumber":"HD2629","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"SSH1","Name":"Steven S. Howitt","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SSH1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T17:38:50.773"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"SSH1","Name":"Steven S. Howitt","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SSH1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T17:38:50.7733333"},{"Id":"JDM1","Name":"Joseph D. McKenna","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JDM1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-31T17:21:59.6766667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3345/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Howitt of Seekonk, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3345) of Steven S. Howitt and Joseph D. McKenna for legislation to prohibit vehicles operating on a spare tire from driving in the passing lane.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 4B of Chapter 89 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by inserting at the end thereof the following sentence:- Vehicles operating on a spare tire shall be prohibited from driving in the lane nearest to the left side of the way, regardless if such a lane is available for travel. \r\n\tSECTION 2. This act shall take effect upon its passage.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}